                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I'm thrilled that Missouri will receive over $216 million in rural healthcare funding, thanks to the Working Families Tax Cuts law that Republicans passed and President Trump signed into law! I was proud to vote for this critical funding to strengthen and transform healthcare in our rural communities. Governor Kehoe and his administration put together a great plan for the funding, which I was also proud to support, and I look forward to seeing the impact it will have on North Missouri.",
